flowchart TD
    A[Daily: approved brand data] --> B[Verify tenant, refuse unapproved]
    B --> C[Redact PII, encrypt per tenant]
    C --> D[Refresh tenant retrieval index]
    C --> E{Enough new data?}
    E -- No --> F[Skip training, keep champion]
    E -- Yes --> G[Extract insights, build dataset]
    G --> H[Train candidate adapter]
    H --> I{G1 data}
    I -- Pass --> J{G2 beats few-shot baseline and champion}
    J -- Pass --> K{G3 canary leakage}
    K -- Pass --> L{G4 latency}
    L -- Pass --> M[Register immutable version]
    M --> N[Canary rollout, move prod pointer]
    N --> O[Monitor]
    O -- Regression --> P[Rollback to previous version]
    I -- Fail --> Q[Reject, keep champion]
    J -- Fail --> Q
    L -- Fail --> Q
    K -- Fail --> R[Discard artefact, raise incident]
